  "pseudocode": "1. ringIndices = map(char -> list of positions)\n2. dp = array of size ring.length filled with 0\n3. for each char in key:\n4.   new_dp = infinity\n5.   for next_pos in ringIndices[char]:\n6.     for prev_pos in dp:\n7.       dist = min(abs(next_pos - prev_pos), ring.len - abs(next_pos - prev_pos))\n8.       new_dp[next_pos] = min(new_dp, dp[prev_pos] + dist + 1)",
